<p>This week we study <em>The Richest Man in Babylon</em> by George S. Clason — one of the most widely read books on personal finance. Through the story of Arkad, the richest man in the ancient city of Babylon, Clason reveals seven timeless financial principles known as the <strong>Seven Cures to a Lean Purse</strong>. These simple but powerful rules have helped millions of people worldwide achieve financial independence.</p>

